      "en": "The king says, ‘Don’t let Hezekiah deceive you, for he will not be able to deliver you out of his hand.",
      "ko": "왕의 말씀이 너희는 히스기야에게 속지 말라 저가 너희를 내 손에서 건져내지 못하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "effdb0929ad7e49450dd1b9f73fafddff4454086a0f33a6f3640ff6bcd4ea1a3",
      "translation_text_hash": "048377546df6c4df0bc8fbb310a327e4c90cf68a60a03088552a38b881ce9873",
