      "en": "Who are they among all the gods of the countries, that have delivered their country out of my hand, that the LORD should deliver Jerusalem out of my hand?’”",
      "ko": "열국의 모든 신 중에 누가 그 땅을 내 손에서 건졌기에 여호와가 예루살렘을 내 손에서 능히 건지겠느냐 하셨느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "61f09b873181e3db2d8adbb5d9bdd9cc97f38bc9c8112d78b2e41bae728f427c",
      "translation_text_hash": "490f4fdc63c1a22d9e037519c1b9a014bbdb1a270758798bb762c526d20767d5",
